WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:38.200
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:38.280 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:58.840 --> 02:59.720
Taisui.

03:00.640 --> 03:02.120
I know you're here.

03:03.720 --> 03:04.600
Come out.

03:16.960 --> 03:18.920
Dongfang Qingcang.

03:19.000 --> 03:21.400
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

03:21.480 --> 03:22.960
I told you long ago

03:23.040 --> 03:24.800
you'd lose her forever.

03:26.120 --> 03:28.360
Give me your immortal body and spirit.

03:28.440 --> 03:31.120
Only I can help you get what you want.

03:31.200 --> 03:33.120
I've been waiting for you
for a long time too.

03:34.960 --> 03:35.880
Good.

03:36.480 --> 03:38.600
Then give me your immortal body.

03:39.360 --> 03:40.400
Do you want it?

03:41.280 --> 03:42.280
Take it.

04:11.920 --> 04:14.240
You! What are you doing?

04:18.360 --> 04:19.519
What are you doing?

04:25.360 --> 04:27.720
This is the sea of your heart.

04:28.320 --> 04:29.280
This is

04:30.120 --> 04:32.400
where you and I will be buried.

04:47.440 --> 04:49.440
Do you think you can trap me here

04:49.520 --> 04:51.280
with your power?

04:51.360 --> 04:52.560
I myself

04:53.720 --> 04:54.880
may not be enough.

04:56.480 --> 04:57.680
But

04:58.560 --> 05:00.960
with the power she planted in my heart,

05:01.480 --> 05:02.840
it will be.

05:51.560 --> 05:52.400
This…

05:53.840 --> 05:54.680
This…

05:55.960 --> 05:56.800
This is…

05:58.200 --> 05:59.080
This is…

06:00.040 --> 06:01.800
This is the power of the Goddess.

06:10.680 --> 06:11.960
You can't get away from it.

06:13.720 --> 06:15.280
Because she has left traces

06:15.800 --> 06:18.080
all over the sea of my heart.

06:18.640 --> 06:20.840
How dare you lie to me?

06:20.920 --> 06:23.120
I only played a small trick

06:23.200 --> 06:24.560
and you swallowed the bait.

06:25.160 --> 06:27.360
Taisui, your delusions of grandeur

06:27.440 --> 06:29.720
have fooled yourself after all.

06:34.120 --> 06:36.280
Dongfang Qingcang, I don't believe you!

06:36.360 --> 06:38.920
I don't believe
you have no delusions at all!

06:55.760 --> 06:57.600
Dongfang Qingcang.

06:58.160 --> 06:59.520
Are you crazy?

07:00.280 --> 07:03.400
We could have lived the same life
as heaven and earth

07:03.480 --> 07:06.720
and become the heartless lord
of the three realms.

07:07.840 --> 07:09.600
But now you want to burn your spirit

07:10.600 --> 07:12.120
for Xiyun

07:12.600 --> 07:14.600
and die with me?

07:16.800 --> 07:17.920
Is it worth it?

07:21.200 --> 07:22.400
The immortals

07:23.680 --> 07:26.560
will gloat at our death.

07:27.120 --> 07:29.000
You are the supreme being
of the three realms.

07:29.480 --> 07:33.080
Are you willing to sacrifice yourself

07:34.800 --> 07:35.920
to save a bunch of nobodies?

07:36.400 --> 07:37.840
Why would I

07:38.680 --> 07:40.040
not die for her?

07:40.120 --> 07:42.320
What about the wishes
of your father and brother?

07:42.400 --> 07:44.240
What about the revival of the Moon Tribe?

07:45.320 --> 07:48.160
Are you going to give up all these?

07:48.760 --> 07:50.400
They already have their own destinations.

07:51.080 --> 07:53.840
Can you even give up Xiyun?

07:55.520 --> 07:56.760
Don't forget.

07:57.920 --> 07:59.200
If we die,

07:59.280 --> 08:01.640
Changheng will get Xiyun

08:01.720 --> 08:03.880
and they can be together forever and ever.

08:05.360 --> 08:06.560
Dongfang Qingcang.

08:08.120 --> 08:09.800
You can't fool me

08:10.640 --> 08:12.440
because I am you.

08:13.320 --> 08:15.680
I know how much you hate

08:15.760 --> 08:17.680
and how grudging you are in your heart.

08:19.560 --> 08:22.120
If you didn't have delusions,

08:23.800 --> 08:26.480
I wouldn't be here.

08:33.720 --> 08:35.000
Our death

08:35.760 --> 08:37.520
can bring her eternal peace.

08:38.679 --> 08:39.880
I have no regrets.

09:00.240 --> 09:01.640
Lord Changheng

09:01.720 --> 09:04.200
guards Yujing and protects the living.

09:04.280 --> 09:05.480
Goddess Xiyun

09:05.960 --> 09:08.080
cultivates all creatures with grace.

09:08.760 --> 09:10.440
The two of them
are a match made in heaven,

09:10.520 --> 09:12.120
bound for a marriage that lasts forever.

09:12.600 --> 09:14.280
Heaven and earth are the witnesses

09:14.360 --> 09:16.120
of their vows.

09:16.200 --> 09:19.360
All the gods felicitate them
upon the completed ceremony.

09:31.840 --> 09:33.920
No.

09:35.560 --> 09:37.720
You must still have a weakness.

09:39.200 --> 09:41.280
You must still have a weakness!

09:41.360 --> 09:43.600
It is a delusion to change fate.

09:43.680 --> 09:46.480
Dongfang Qingcang,
do you really understand?

09:46.560 --> 09:49.760
Do you really know
what price you have to pay?

09:50.320 --> 09:53.800
I am an ancient evil god
who is immortal and indestructible.

09:54.520 --> 09:56.840
If you want to completely destroy me,

09:56.920 --> 10:00.000
it's not enough
to burn my primordial spirit.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.640
I'm afraid of nothing.

10:06.120 --> 10:07.760
Is that so?

10:07.840 --> 10:11.200
Then your existence will be completely
erased by heaven's rules,

10:11.840 --> 10:15.760
just like you've never existed
in the three realms.

10:18.560 --> 10:19.520
Taisui.

10:20.840 --> 10:23.480
These are your fears,

10:24.280 --> 10:25.320
not mine.

10:26.640 --> 10:28.320
I have let go of everything.

10:29.040 --> 10:31.080
There is nothing in this world

10:31.600 --> 10:33.320
that can shake me.

10:38.600 --> 10:40.800
But Xiyun won't remember

10:46.720 --> 10:48.840
all that you've given to her.

10:50.480 --> 10:53.680
All the happiness and pain

10:54.640 --> 10:55.600
you have experienced.

10:56.680 --> 10:59.560
Even the fight against fate.

11:00.400 --> 11:03.120
However strong the love is,

11:03.200 --> 11:04.520
she will forget it.

11:05.080 --> 11:07.520
She will truly forget you forever.

11:09.160 --> 11:10.240
Aren't you afraid

11:12.040 --> 11:14.320
of all this?

11:16.720 --> 11:17.560
I see.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.480
So what?

11:24.960 --> 11:26.880
Dongfang Qingcang.

11:26.960 --> 11:29.200
This moment of your wavering

11:29.280 --> 11:31.720
will be enough.

13:30.200 --> 13:32.280
Taisui has regained his immortal body.

13:32.920 --> 13:34.560
He is in Spirit-Shattering Abyss.

13:43.920 --> 13:46.400
- Why would this happen?
- Yes, what's going on?

14:49.680 --> 14:50.520
Dongfang Qingcang!

14:50.600 --> 14:51.680
He is not Dongfang Qingcang.

14:52.360 --> 14:53.600
He is Evil God Taisui.

14:54.600 --> 14:55.760
No way.

14:55.840 --> 14:57.840
He has a strong mind.

14:57.920 --> 15:00.040
How could he possibly be controlled
by Taisui?

15:00.120 --> 15:01.200
That's impossible.

15:13.120 --> 15:14.320
What Chidi said

15:15.640 --> 15:16.560
is true.

15:17.960 --> 15:21.360
When the ancient gods and goddesses
joined forces to seal Taisui,

15:21.920 --> 15:24.080
the violent and evil qi
in the ancient barbaric era

15:24.160 --> 15:25.840
were also suppressed under Xishan.

15:25.920 --> 15:27.920
If he lifts the seal

15:28.000 --> 15:29.600
and releases them all,

15:33.240 --> 15:34.400
the people of the three realms

15:35.360 --> 15:37.160
will be flooded with calamities

15:37.640 --> 15:39.280
and return to the barbaric wilderness.

15:45.320 --> 15:46.240
All immortals,

15:48.120 --> 15:49.440
work together to suppress it!

16:24.440 --> 16:25.480
Let me go.

16:28.160 --> 16:29.920
Orchid, come back!

17:16.280 --> 17:18.359
Orchid, come back!

17:33.400 --> 17:35.880
Evil God Taisui has taken over
Dongfang Qingcang's immortal body

17:35.960 --> 17:37.040
and will soon restore power.

17:37.720 --> 17:39.360
Orchid has just transformed into a human.

17:39.440 --> 17:41.320
She hasn't fully recovered
the power of the Goddess.

17:41.400 --> 17:43.000
There is no chance of victory for her.

17:43.080 --> 17:44.320
It's too dangerous.

17:44.800 --> 17:46.840
- Goddess, come back now!
- Come back!

17:50.160 --> 17:51.320
Now that this has happened,

17:51.400 --> 17:54.160
we can only try our best
to hold down the seal

17:54.240 --> 17:55.520
and buy her time.

19:43.000 --> 19:43.960
We Moon Tribe soldiers

19:44.040 --> 19:46.400
have come to help Shuiyuntian

19:47.320 --> 19:49.040
to kill the Evil God Taisui

19:51.400 --> 19:53.400
by the order of the Moon Supreme,
Dongfang Qingcang.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.640
Lord Xunfeng.

20:04.720 --> 20:07.440
Do we really have to fight
against Moon Supreme

20:07.520 --> 20:08.640
for Shuiyuntian?

20:08.720 --> 20:09.680
Surely not.

20:10.840 --> 20:12.280
This is not for the sake of someone.

20:13.160 --> 20:14.360
This is for the three realms.

20:16.240 --> 20:17.360
I will never make

20:19.720 --> 20:21.120
my past mistakes ever again.

20:59.880 --> 21:01.160
Orchid, stop!

21:01.920 --> 21:03.400
It's useless for you to go there now.

21:04.120 --> 21:05.640
You are no match for Taisui.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.800
Dongfang Qingcang…

21:07.800 --> 21:09.120
He is no longer in this world.

22:48.280 --> 22:49.440
Orchid

22:49.520 --> 22:51.640
has awakened the supreme divine power
in her bloodline.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.920
This is Hellfire.

22:53.640 --> 22:55.200
Moon Supreme has regained consciousness

22:55.280 --> 22:56.320
and his Hellfire!

22:56.800 --> 22:57.760
No.

22:58.960 --> 23:00.160
This is not Hellfire.

23:01.840 --> 23:03.200
This is Glazed Fire.

23:03.280 --> 23:04.640
Glazed Fire?

23:05.200 --> 23:07.720
It is the fire of compassion
that has been lost since ancient times.

23:08.280 --> 23:10.520
The person needs to be tempered
by emotions and suffering

23:11.440 --> 23:13.160
but still keep his original heart.

23:14.760 --> 23:17.120
Only those who have
great love and compassion

23:18.040 --> 23:19.360
can harness it.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.640
I never thought

23:23.720 --> 23:26.000
people from Moon Tribe
can master the Glazed Fire.

23:29.680 --> 23:30.880
Dongfang Qingcang.

23:37.040 --> 23:38.120
Orchid.

23:46.080 --> 23:47.200
Kill me.

23:48.440 --> 23:51.320
Now that I am one
with the primordial spirit of Taisui,

23:53.360 --> 23:55.600
you can kill Taisui if you kill me.

23:57.520 --> 23:58.680
Hurry!

23:59.360 --> 24:00.920
I can't hold out much longer.

24:01.000 --> 24:02.080
No.

24:02.800 --> 24:04.040
I can't do it.

24:04.120 --> 24:05.600
That's right.

24:05.680 --> 24:06.680
You can't do it.

24:07.320 --> 24:10.160
You can't do it, Xiyun.

24:10.240 --> 24:12.560
I know you love him

24:12.640 --> 24:14.480
more than your own life.

24:14.560 --> 24:15.560
Taisui.

24:15.640 --> 24:18.280
Your enemy is me. Let him go!

24:23.560 --> 24:24.480
Orchid.

24:26.640 --> 24:27.880
Look at me.

24:31.840 --> 24:32.920
Kill me.

24:34.040 --> 24:34.920
No!

24:35.560 --> 24:37.080
I don't want to!

24:38.280 --> 24:39.560
I don't want to!

24:41.840 --> 24:43.280
If I don't die,

24:43.840 --> 24:46.080
Taisui will continue
to plague the three realms.

24:47.120 --> 24:49.320
Then everything you've done
will go in vain.

24:50.840 --> 24:53.240
It's my destiny to save the world,

24:53.720 --> 24:55.240
not yours.

25:05.080 --> 25:06.520
But it's my mission

25:08.440 --> 25:10.120
to save you.

25:29.160 --> 25:30.080
Hurry!

25:32.560 --> 25:34.200
I can't hold on anymore.

25:40.120 --> 25:41.720
Xiyun.

25:41.800 --> 25:45.680
How can you kill Dongfang Qingcang
with your own hands?

25:45.760 --> 25:47.280
You can't do it.

25:55.680 --> 25:57.000
Orchid.

25:57.080 --> 25:58.960
I can't hold on anymore.

25:59.040 --> 26:00.240
I beg of you.

26:01.000 --> 26:02.480
Hurry!

27:31.720 --> 27:32.840
Little Flower Spirit.

27:38.320 --> 27:41.200
I said I would change your fate for you.

27:47.040 --> 27:48.200
I did it.

28:09.840 --> 28:10.920
Big Blockhead.

28:11.960 --> 28:12.840
No.

28:20.160 --> 28:21.240
No.

28:22.440 --> 28:23.680
No!

28:23.760 --> 28:24.920
Big Blockhead.

28:26.560 --> 28:27.440
No.

28:28.200 --> 28:29.640
No.

28:48.400 --> 28:50.560
Don't go.

28:51.840 --> 28:53.160
No!

28:54.360 --> 28:56.320
Dongfang Qingcang!

30:17.880 --> 30:19.320
Come and take a look.

30:19.400 --> 30:21.600
- Come and take a look.
- Take a look.

30:25.120 --> 30:26.040
Will my brother

30:26.680 --> 30:27.800
come back?

30:28.880 --> 30:30.720
He took everything on

30:31.720 --> 30:33.400
for me.

30:35.520 --> 30:37.160
His life can't be brought back.

30:55.440 --> 30:56.400
Xunfeng.

30:58.040 --> 30:59.800
Do you believe in miracles?

31:04.200 --> 31:05.280
I don't know.

31:06.400 --> 31:07.840
Everything in this world

31:08.720 --> 31:10.200
happens so fast

31:13.040 --> 31:14.360
except for love.

31:21.280 --> 31:28.240
500 YEARS LATER

31:38.120 --> 31:40.520
The hatred and war
between immortals and the Moon Tribe

31:40.600 --> 31:43.320
have lasted
for tens of thousands of years,

31:43.400 --> 31:45.360
causing many deaths.

31:46.280 --> 31:49.760
But one of the most magical
and powerful forces

31:49.840 --> 31:51.600
in the three realms

31:51.680 --> 31:53.400
finally changed all this.

31:54.680 --> 31:55.960
That is love.

31:56.680 --> 31:58.040
It makes everyone

31:58.120 --> 32:00.000
a better version of themselves.

32:00.960 --> 32:02.760
For the most cautious
and restrained people,

32:03.440 --> 32:05.440
love can set them free

32:05.520 --> 32:07.360
and help them find their true desire.

32:08.920 --> 32:11.400
My name is Xiao Run.

32:11.480 --> 32:13.080
You can call me Mr. Xiao.

32:14.040 --> 32:15.080
Mr. Xiao.

32:15.160 --> 32:17.720
Yesterday, you said
the bad Evil God Taisui had come.

32:17.800 --> 32:19.000
What happened after that?

32:19.080 --> 32:20.520
- Yes, what happened after that?
- Yes, what happened after that?

32:20.600 --> 32:21.680
After that…

32:21.760 --> 32:22.640
Xiao Run.

32:24.520 --> 32:26.280
For the most unruly and capricious people,

32:26.880 --> 32:29.880
love can make them strong, open-minded,

32:29.960 --> 32:31.440
and broad-minded.

32:31.520 --> 32:32.720
Join the army for training?

32:33.400 --> 32:34.440
Have you really decided?

32:36.960 --> 32:38.840
I've always admired the late God of War.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.880
When I was young, I always thought

32:40.960 --> 32:43.440
I would become the God of War
in Shuiyuntian

32:43.520 --> 32:45.200
and protect the lives in three realms too.

32:47.240 --> 32:48.240
But later,

32:48.960 --> 32:50.840
I indulged in selfish delusions
for a while.

32:52.680 --> 32:54.080
Not only did it cause you trouble,

32:55.760 --> 32:57.280
I also forgot my original intention.

32:58.960 --> 32:59.880
No.

33:01.200 --> 33:02.200
You're a good person.

33:02.760 --> 33:04.080
I just couldn't respond to you.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.520
It's all in the past.

33:13.640 --> 33:15.640
You treat me like a good friend.

33:16.560 --> 33:18.720
I also consider you my buddy in life.

33:21.680 --> 33:22.880
Your buddy in life?

33:24.320 --> 33:25.640
Let me ask you.

33:25.720 --> 33:28.320
Are Xiao Run and Qu Shui buddies?

33:29.440 --> 33:30.360
Of course they are.

33:30.920 --> 33:33.720
Are Lord Changheng
and the Moon Supreme, Dongfang Qingcang

33:33.800 --> 33:34.760
confidants?

33:35.760 --> 33:36.920
Of course they are.

33:37.000 --> 33:38.760
Since this kind of affection

33:38.840 --> 33:40.640
can go beyond status

33:40.720 --> 33:41.960
and racial difference,

33:42.840 --> 33:45.040
why can't it break the gender gap?

33:47.840 --> 33:49.400
Fairy Danyin, you're right.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.240
What about you?

33:55.240 --> 33:56.280
Will you really

33:56.960 --> 33:58.200
no longer be the God of War?

34:00.080 --> 34:01.720
Now that the three realms are at peace,

34:01.800 --> 34:03.320
I just want to travel around the world

34:03.400 --> 34:04.480
as a loose immortal.

34:05.640 --> 34:07.240
The position of God of War is now vacant.

34:07.960 --> 34:09.800
I'm expecting you to come and get it.

34:12.159 --> 34:13.000
Don't worry.

34:13.920 --> 34:14.920
It won't take long.

34:17.679 --> 34:19.480
For the most narrow-minded
and jealous people,

34:20.040 --> 34:21.400
love makes them grow

34:21.960 --> 34:24.440
to be tolerant and responsible.

34:24.520 --> 34:26.719
I see. Do it this way.

34:26.800 --> 34:27.960
Thank you for your hard work.

34:28.040 --> 34:29.440
Yes, my lord.

34:40.920 --> 34:43.000
Your Highness has become
more sophisticated,

34:43.080 --> 34:44.719
quite like the previous Moon Supreme.

34:46.360 --> 34:49.280
I've been holding the position
for my brother for 500 years.

34:50.560 --> 34:51.520
I wonder

34:52.199 --> 34:53.560
when he'll come back.

34:54.639 --> 34:56.280
If he really can't come back,

34:56.360 --> 34:58.640
you and I will have
to take on the responsibility

34:58.720 --> 35:00.080
to protect all of this,

35:00.920 --> 35:02.080
so that the Moon Tribe

35:02.880 --> 35:03.880
can remain peaceful

35:04.840 --> 35:05.920
and prosperous.

35:20.320 --> 35:21.920
For the most deceitful person,

35:22.480 --> 35:25.440
love makes her sincere and reliable.

35:25.920 --> 35:27.320
Have you learned your lesson?

35:27.400 --> 35:28.560
Yes.

35:28.640 --> 35:31.480
I'll never lie again.

35:32.360 --> 35:34.000
- Be careful.
- Good girl.

35:35.280 --> 35:37.040
You're not orphans anymore.

35:37.120 --> 35:39.520
From now on, I'll take care of you.

35:39.600 --> 35:41.200
So don't lie and cheat anymore.

35:42.000 --> 35:44.760
You have to be a decent person
from now on.

35:44.840 --> 35:45.960
Got it?

35:46.040 --> 35:47.240
Ms. Jieli.

35:47.320 --> 35:49.760
Were you also an honest child
when you were a child?

35:53.000 --> 35:54.640
When I was a child…

35:55.960 --> 35:58.360
I used to misbehave and make mistakes too.

35:58.440 --> 36:00.040
But now, I'm all right.

36:00.120 --> 36:02.200
I'm honest and upright, and I don't lie.

36:02.680 --> 36:04.080
Ms. Jieli is right.

36:04.840 --> 36:07.480
You should listen to her from now on.

36:13.280 --> 36:14.480
Where did you go?

36:18.560 --> 36:20.760
Stupid Black Dragon,
did you go drinking again?

36:23.320 --> 36:24.320
I didn't.

36:24.400 --> 36:25.760
You didn't?

36:25.840 --> 36:27.880
- You've been drinking.
- You must have been drinking.

36:27.960 --> 36:29.400
- I didn't.
- You did.

36:29.480 --> 36:31.080
- Admit it.
- Bad Black Dragon.

36:31.600 --> 36:34.800
For someone who makes a momentary mistake
and goes astray,

36:34.880 --> 36:38.400
love can hold him
before he finally falls into the abyss

36:38.480 --> 36:40.600
and make him come to his senses.

36:52.840 --> 36:54.800
Look, it's Cloud-Whale.

36:59.720 --> 37:00.560
Love

37:01.440 --> 37:03.280
can make a heartless person

37:03.840 --> 37:06.360
understand compassion and love

37:07.560 --> 37:10.200
and even give up everything
for the one he loves,

37:11.040 --> 37:12.280
including

37:13.560 --> 37:14.920
his own life.

38:23.280 --> 38:24.680
I'm back.
